# Keystrokes that trial S1 replays on large-note.md.
#
# One step per line. Blank lines and lines starting with # don't count.
#
#   goto start | goto end      caret at the start or the end of the note
#   goto before <text>         caret before the first <text>
#   goto after <text>          caret after the first <text>
#   type <text>                one key press per character, to the end of the line
#   key <key> [shift] [xN]     a key press, N times; keys use egui's names
#   paste <text>               one paste; \n stands for a line break
#
# A goto places the caret without a keystroke, and the replay doesn't time
# it. The replay times every key press and paste from its arrival to the end
# of the frame that shows it.

# At the start of the body: a new first paragraph.
goto before This notebook collects the team's working notes.
type Updated weekly, newest entries last.
key Enter
key Enter
key Backspace

# In the middle: finish the review's opening line, paste a list, then
# select two rows upward and delete them.
goto after Halfway through the year, the team reviewed every open plan.
type  Most plans shipped on time, and two moved to the next quarter.
key Enter
key Enter
paste - Follow up with design\n- Book the review room\n  - Ask for the large one\n
type Next steps are in the plan.
key ArrowUp shift x2
key Backspace

# At the end: a new section.
goto end
key Enter
type ## Wrap-up
key Enter
key Enter
type The year closed with every open task reviewed.
key Backspace x9
type checked.
